  "details": "i'm making my first flight world, and i noticed that the glitch of going too far from the spawn point is affecting how far can fighters go, can this glitch be fixed? i'm quite sure that there is a canny already and a world already fixed that issue, this is the world that fixed the issue: https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_7a001430-07b4-42f8-b24e-206a8dc75a8e&instanceId=8078~region(us)\n\nflight week is coming soon and people will notice this bug even more, i suggest looking at how that person fixed it, and fixing it, i don't know if this will ever be forwarded to a dev but i'm typing it here.\n\nthis happens in any world if you walk far away, clients abuse this to send you 9999km away to crash you.",
